 "remarks": "Elevated Living in Norwalk's Cranbury Section Everything you need is right outside your door. This beautifully renovated one-bedroom with a versatile loft offers 892 square feet of bright, modern living on the fourth floor of a well-kept elevator building. Start your morning with coffee on your private balcony and take in the city views, then end the day right back there, unwinding as the neighborhood settles in. Inside, fresh modern finishes run throughout. The loft, with its Murphy bed, adapts to however you live: a cozy guest retreat when friends visit, a quiet home office on workdays, or a reading nook all your own. The location is as convenient as it gets. Club Studio Fitness, Walmart, and ASML are all just minutes away, so workouts, errands, and your commute are easy. Ample street parking means no stress for you or your guests. Stylish, comfortable, and perfectly placed. Come see why Cranbury is such a wonderful place to call home.",
